  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/banner.png\" alt=\"Epic Fight 橫幅\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/bePatron?u=53051224\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/patreon.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fNbAJwj8RHg\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/discord.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@yesman4100\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/youtube.png\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/Antikythera-Studios/epicfight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/github.png\" alt=\"GitHub\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fepic-fight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/modrinth.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p>\n<h2>Epic Fight</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Epic Fight 為您的遊戲體驗增添了複雜的遊戲機制與戰鬥風格。融合了類魂系戰鬥元素以及獨特且打破常規的動畫處理方式，Epic Fight 將把您的遊戲體驗提升至全新境界，並沿途帶來精彩的挑戰。</em></p>\n<p><strong>全新機制：</strong>您將面對改寫版的 Minecraft 戰鬥系統，所有實體都具備全新且具挑戰性的戰鬥機制。Epic Fight 徹底重做了遊戲體驗，將來自 FromSoftware 知名作品如《Dark Souls》系列、《隻狼》與《艾爾登法環》等遊戲的「類魂系戰鬥」帶入其中。</p>\n<p><strong>難度設定：</strong>Epic Fight 初上手時可能令人望之卻步，特別是對於從未體驗過類魂系戰鬥挑戰的玩家而言。然而，本模組是為所有玩家設計的。我們確保了提供多種武器與技能，讓每位玩家都能找到適合自己的遊玩風格。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p>\n<h2>✨ 特色功能</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>類魂系戰鬥</strong> - 探索一個擁有全新實體行為、挑戰與可製作物品的世界！</li>\n<li><strong>技能系統</strong> - 尋找、學習並精通酷炫的新能力，解鎖對抗敵人的嶄新戰鬥方式！</li>\n<li><strong>全新武器</strong> - 製作擁有不同技能與遊玩風格的酷炫新武器！</li>\n<li><strong>彈性設定</strong> - Epic Fight 擁有極高的自訂彈性，試試各種設定選項，將其調整至符合您的喜好！</li>\n<li><strong>多人共遊</strong> - 可以單獨遊玩或與朋友一起享受本模組，組成探險小隊並共同冒險！</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p>\n<h2>📷 遊戲畫面</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/ZZZZZZZZZ1.png\" alt=\"遊戲畫面\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/1827189298.png\" alt=\"遊戲畫面\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/207981072389172389.png\" alt=\"遊戲畫面\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p>\n<h2>📥 安裝說明</h2>\n<p><strong>需同時安裝於客戶端與伺服器！</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p>\n<h2>⚙️ 設定檔</h2>\n<p>大多數選項可直接在遊戲內修改，無需重新啟動。請開啟<strong>Mods → Epic Fight → Config</strong>，或直接編輯 <code>.minecraft/config/epicfight-common.toml</code> 檔案。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong>對設定檔所做的修改將在下次載入世界時生效。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p>\n<h2>❤️ 製作人員</h2>\n<p>由 <strong>Antikythera Studios</strong> 精心打造。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>程式碼與美術</strong> - Antikythera Studios 團隊</li>\n<li><strong>翻譯支援</strong> - blade_master_x, nameed, smokingbastard, luke_nogami, xablauler, a_k1m0, requiem4, shape.nan, ig114514, andy852546, kevinl2000, icewolf8964, yesman_0, kilotheneko, banikula, majmun.boy 以及眾多其他協力者。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>喜歡這個模組嗎？在倉庫留下 ⭐ 並在 Modrinth / CurseForge 推薦本模組，將對開發團隊提供莫大的幫助。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d2724\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/support.png\" alt=\"贊助與合作夥伴\"></a></p>",
